    the narration; routes.streaming strips it before the reply becomes posts, so
    it never enters the transcript and never reaches the player. Rendered only
    when the ledger is switched on (turnstate_depth > 0); the section list keeps
    it off the opener.
    Vars: transient_tracker (bool), transient_fields ([str]). -#}
{%- if transient_tracker %}# Transient state tracker
After the last line of narration, and only there, add one fenced block:

```state
{"<character name>": { {% for f in transient_fields %}"{{ f }}": "…"{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %} }}
```

One entry per character you voiced this turn, keyed by the exact name you label their dialogue with. Each value is a short phrase — a few words, never a sentence. Omit a field the scene does not support, omit a character you did not move, and omit the block entirely if you have nothing to record. Write nothing after it.{% endif -%}
